lture is functioning smoothly and  there are no shortages of food but many  reject that and with more than half of  India's workforce employed in  agriculture  X  say it must do more to help farmers and  secure the harvest for the next season  Elizabeth puranam al-jazeera Boleyn  shared author Pradesh
 

